{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1111306001:0":{"text":"家の中が綺麗になった！これならお母さんが戻っても怒られないね。","source_cn":"家里终于恢复整洁啦！妈妈回来就不会训我啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B0CDFB49747AE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111306002:0":{"text":"やっと見つけた！はい、止血の薬草だよ。","source_cn":"这是止血的草药，总算找到了，送给你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD56AD906AF300C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::0":{"text":"止血の薬草","source_cn":"止血的草药","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC347260626D5CE8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111306003:0":{"text":"ありがたく受け取るよ。","source_cn":"谢谢，我收下了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77DF85146691296B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111306004:0":{"text":"あとはどこかで少し休めば、サテラも目を覚ますだろう。","source_cn":"接下来只需稍加休息，萨忒娜应该会很快醒过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AAD067123CD562D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111306005:0":{"text":"うちの家は狭いからなぁ……そうだ、<sty